    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1950628065375089144",
      "url": "https://x.com/BG_Crypto4/status/1950628065375089144",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/BG_Crypto4/status/1950628065375089144",
      "text": "The @AwakenHunterNFT NFT Collection on @Ronin_Network is making an impact. Ronin creators are flexing their Awakening Hunters NFTs as pfps on X, lighting up the feed with pure fire! If you Mint 1 AH, you  got 1 free, Super Rare AH's are starting at 70 RON, and holding 7 AHs gets you into the Top 100 club. IRL perks are already kicking off, such as entrance to a famous gaming convention. Shout out to the PH 🇵🇭 community.\nThe anime NFT craze is just warming up 🌊🎴\nLet's Dive into the floors, stats, and all the juicy alpha 🧵⤵️\n\nData 📊  (Will be gathering data from both OS and Ronin Market for data)\n- 5,555 Supply collection\n- Mint Price was 150 RON\n- For every AH you minted you got airdropped one AH\n- Collection started trading on July 14th, 2025\n- 1,737 Total holders\n- 31% Unique Holders\n- 895 Total listings on Ronin Market\n- 120 NFT listings on @opensea\n- 1,015 out of 5555 = 18.27% of supply is listed\n- 1,046+ Cumulative NFT sales\n- 47.20 RON floor [Opensea]\n- 42 RON floor [Ronin Market]\n- Instant sell offer of 32.51 WRON | 31.12 lower than floor [Opensea]\n- Instant sell offer of 33.25 WRON | 20.83 lower than floor [Mavis Market]\n- 1,991 Transactions of NFT activity on the ERC 721 contract\n\nSuper Rare Trait Floor Prices ✨Cheapest price from both markets\n- 70 RON floor for 1 Super Rare AH trait [1,672 Supply]\n- 136 RON floor for 2 Super Rare AH trait [237 Supply]\n- 650 RON floor for 3 Super Rare AH trait [22 Supply]\n\n- Top 3 Holders 🥇🥈🥉\n1. 0x83585ba03cb784fda813ae429352238736fb75c6 with 983 AH's | 17.7% of supply\n2.@MarkofTheZeal.ron with 59 AH's | 1.06% of supply\n3. Matt.ron with 49 AH's Mokis | 0.88% of supply\n\nTOP 100 placement: If you have 6 AH's you have a chance to get in but with 7 you get in automatically. Theres a lot of people with 6 Ah's which is why with 7 you get in right away. 🚨\n\nFloor Depth ⛰️ $RON\n41.5-48.2 RON = 25 Listings\n48.2-54.9 RON = 24 Listings\n54.9-61.6 RON = 57 Listings\n61.6-68.3 RON= 43 Listings\n68.3-75 RON= 38 Listings\n75 & Above = 717 Listing\n\n- Owner Distribution Percentages 🔢\n1. 1 NFT 27.34%\n2. 2-3 NFTs 51.69%\n3. 4-10 NFTs 19.18%\n4. 11-25 NFTs 1.32%\n5. 26-50 NFTs 0.34%\n6. 51+ NFTs 0.11%\n\n- Trading Volume & Rank below 🏆  [Mavis Market Data]\n - #4 NFT Collection on the 24 hour time frame with 61 sales which led to 3,395 RON\n- #12 NFT Collection on the 7 Day time frame with 181 sales which led to 10,040 RON\n- #6 NFT Collection on the 30 Day timeframe with 1,035 sales which led to 77,820 RON\n- #68 NFT Collection on the All category [68 out of 203] with 1,046 cumulative sales which led to 79,190 RON\n\nProject Description 🧐 \n- Awakening Hunters is the first high quality anime digital layer IP built on the Ronin Network, combining anime art and gaming culture through premium digital collectibles.\n- Each character features detailed designs and a strong digital identity, created for fans seeking deep, culture driven experiences.\n- These collectibles are designed with future use across multiple platforms and games in mind\n- The IP will also expand into areas like gaming and anime conventions, offering fans new ways to engage with developers, builders, and creators from both the Web2 and Web3 communities.\n- Awakening Hunters NFT holders were granted free access to the Philippine GameDev Expo, one of the largest indie game and B2B industry events in the Philippines. \n\nLinks 🔗 \n- AH Collection: https://t.co/1Kmvnqucm3\n\nData: @Agent_YP, @aixbt_agent and @jaihoz_ 💡 \nFollow: @AwakenHunterNFT and @daryl24_eth for latest updates ⚡️ \nFollow me for latest updates within the @Ronin_Network. ✨",
